{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105705","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105705/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105705/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105705/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105705","id":3016742312,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6zz9Wo","number":105705,"title":"NavigationAgent2D calculates incorrect path with Corridorfunnel path processing","user":{"login":"th1z","id":1029228,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjkyMjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1029228?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/th1z","html_url":"https://github.com/th1z","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th1z/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th1z/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th1z/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th1z/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th1z/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th1z/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th1z/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th1z/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th1z/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","color":"4466ff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1752040694,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzUyMDQwNjk0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:navigation","name":"topic:navigation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-04-24T10:14:52Z","updated_at":"2026-08-09T09:10:05Z","closed_at":"2026-08-09T09:09:59Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5.dev2 and older versions\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev2 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7260) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-6700K CPU @ 4.00GHz (8 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nNavigationAgent2D with Corridorfunnel path processing calculates path with detours in some cases. This happens when the NavAgent is required to navigate around holes in the navigation polygon. It happens quite often when the navigation mesh is triangulated into very thin polygons.  \n\nThe same issue is also reported and here:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/67480\nand here\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/74696\n\nBut is still not fixed by the mentioned pull request [#79228](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/79228)\n\nExamples:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b187782c-0889-42cc-b15a-bfe8e7b161b6)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0304918d-ed17-4347-bec9-16d947cb308d)\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Add a Navigation2DRegion with a new navigation polygon\n- Add many inner polygons (holes)\n- Set up basic pathfinding (obstacle avoidance not necessary)\n- Move around until the issue occurs (it's sporadic)\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[BugTest.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19889061/BugTest.zip)\n\nI updated the MRP from Issue [#67480](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/67480) to Godot 4.5 and adjusted the positions of the objects, so that the bug will immediately occur when the project is executed. ","closed_by":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105705/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105705/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}